This repository contains a collection of three simple QBasic programs that calculate Bayes' theorem and the Pythagorean theorem, and generate random numbers according to Benford's Law. 

To run this code, you can use online BASIC runners such as [QBJS](https://qbjs.org/) or terminal-based interpreters like DOSBox. 

If you have any comments or would like more information, please feel free to email me at vega1227.48656C6C6F@proton.me. 

Best regards.
